Package: gRm
Title: Graphical Log-Linear Rasch Models in R
Version: 1.2.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Andreas", "Jensen", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "aeje@sund.ku.dk")
  )
Description: Provides source-faithful R implementations of selected DIGRAM
    computations for graphical log-linear Rasch models. The package supports
    model construction, fitting, screening, and diagnostic summaries through a
    compact R API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/ERRTG/gRm
